WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.040 --> 01:39.990
Episode 25:
Escape!

01:48.080 --> 01:50.000
Just Remy!
- Why?

01:50.170 --> 01:51.510
Why just me?

01:52.130 --> 01:52.760
Remy!

01:53.180 --> 01:53.750
Get away!

01:55.540 --> 01:56.790
Mattia!

01:56.930 --> 01:57.680
Hiyah!

01:59.890 --> 02:02.240
Remy!
- Remy!

02:05.950 --> 02:07.230
Remy!

02:09.800 --> 02:11.280
Remy! Remy!

02:12.220 --> 02:14.520
Mattia! Help me!

02:17.560 --> 02:18.740
Mattia...

02:21.570 --> 02:24.260
Will I ever see Mattia and the rest again?

02:25.370 --> 02:27.010
No, I won't accept that!

02:42.340 --> 02:44.100
I told you not to look outside!

02:52.820 --> 02:55.140
Let me go!
Let me go!

02:55.630 --> 02:57.160
You'll stay in here!

02:57.960 --> 02:59.820
Why do I have to be locked in?

03:01.340 --> 03:03.130
Send me back to my friends!

03:03.350 --> 03:08.970
Soon Gaspard will come to pick you up. You're an important lady, after all.

03:24.290 --> 03:27.140
I wonder if big brother Mattia found Remy...

03:27.560 --> 03:32.500
Capi's with him.
They'll find her for sure.

03:32.510 --> 03:35.150
Mattia will follow her anywhere.
And then he'll take her to her mother.

03:35.450 --> 03:38.900
But big brother Mattia is by himself, so I'm worried.

03:39.300 --> 03:40.930
Don't worry.

03:54.540 --> 03:59.260
What did he mean that I'm a lady?

04:10.320 --> 04:12.960
Is Remy here in this town?

04:21.440 --> 04:26.030
Is that man, Gaspard, a bad man?

04:26.330 --> 04:27.690
Yes, madam.

04:27.710 --> 04:32.170
He forces kids to work and squeezes money out of them.

04:32.650 --> 04:34.660
He lives on a backstreet in Paris.

04:34.670 --> 04:36.210
It's such an awful place.

04:39.500 --> 04:41.260
Poor Remy.

04:45.790 --> 04:48.230
We have to rescue her quickly.

04:48.830 --> 04:52.800
He's such a cowardly man to be hiding your daughter.

04:54.800 --> 04:55.700
Come in.

04:56.420 --> 04:57.480
Excuse me.

04:59.470 --> 05:01.360
Mr. Blair, is there any new information?

05:04.240 --> 05:06.370
I got a message from Gaspard.

05:07.990 --> 05:09.090
Really?

05:09.110 --> 05:11.540
Then, we can see Remy, right?

05:13.500 --> 05:15.670
There is one condition though.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.670
It's money, isn't it?

05:21.300 --> 05:22.690
I'll do what I must.

05:22.700 --> 05:27.390
I want to get her back as soon as possible.

05:41.490 --> 05:42.420
Capi!

05:49.890 --> 05:50.950
<i>Remy...</i>

05:51.510 --> 05:53.750
<i>I promise I'll come and save you.</i>

05:56.940 --> 05:58.460
We'll wait until it gets dark.

06:29.660 --> 06:31.830
That howl... Capi?

06:32.950 --> 06:34.840
What a noisy stray dog.

06:45.900 --> 06:47.130
Mattia!

06:48.720 --> 06:49.470
Mattia!

06:50.120 --> 06:51.000
Remy!

06:54.870 --> 06:55.770
Mattia...

06:57.950 --> 06:58.770
All right.

06:59.440 --> 07:01.320
I'm counting on you, Joli-Coeur.

07:20.910 --> 07:22.930
Oh... Joli-Coeur.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.660
Good boy.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.160
Remy!

07:26.220 --> 07:27.170
Pull up the rope!

07:27.590 --> 07:28.420
Okay.

07:56.300 --> 07:57.190
Yah!

08:07.140 --> 08:07.510
Remy!

08:10.590 --> 08:11.510
Hurry up, Remy!

08:11.890 --> 08:12.740
Okay.

08:18.240 --> 08:19.440
Hurry up!

08:38.110 --> 08:39.290
Open the door, Remy!

08:41.640 --> 08:43.250
Remy, don't stop!

08:43.260 --> 08:44.110
Hurry up!

08:47.620 --> 08:49.380
Hey, what are you doing?

08:49.400 --> 08:51.040
Open the door, Remy!

08:51.070 --> 08:53.090
Open up! Open it!

08:54.290 --> 08:57.330
Open it now or I'll punish you!

08:57.340 --> 08:59.990
Damn it!
- Move!

09:08.530 --> 09:09.920
Damn it!

09:15.570 --> 09:16.800
Remy...

09:18.530 --> 09:20.080
I won't let you escape!

09:23.970 --> 09:25.290
Mattia!

09:26.400 --> 09:27.540
Remy, let go!

09:28.880 --> 09:30.830
Mattia, you...

09:31.020 --> 09:32.090
Hurry up!

09:38.000 --> 09:40.180
Mattia!
- Get them!

09:40.230 --> 09:42.430
Don't let them escape!

09:42.790 --> 09:44.310
Let's go!
- Okay.

09:50.120 --> 09:52.320
Damn it! Where'd they go?

09:52.800 --> 09:55.390
How did Mattia find her here?

09:59.190 --> 10:02.100
I don't think they can get very far.

10:02.120 --> 10:04.850
You look that way!
- All right.

10:17.030 --> 10:18.880
We're safe now.

10:25.670 --> 10:27.020
Mattia!

10:43.690 --> 10:44.570
Remy...

10:44.840 --> 10:46.000
We need to talk.

11:04.130 --> 11:05.390
My mother?

11:07.770 --> 11:11.960
Mrs. Milligan is my mother?

11:17.150 --> 11:20.660
It can't be... That's...

11:40.790 --> 11:45.840
When I was alone, she was so kind to me.

11:46.500 --> 11:54.400
I kept thinking how wonderful it would be if Mrs. Milligan was my real mother.

12:00.430 --> 12:02.650
She's your real mother.

12:06.110 --> 12:07.860
Mary told us everything.

12:08.580 --> 12:11.350
You were stolen when you were a baby.

12:11.740 --> 12:13.120
Stolen?

12:13.270 --> 12:16.690
The Milligan family looked for you everywhere.

12:16.840 --> 12:21.630
But they never thought that you'd been taken from England to France.

12:22.080 --> 12:26.000
That's right. I was found in Paris.

12:26.580 --> 12:32.150
I was found by father Barberin and taken to Chavanon village.

12:38.430 --> 12:39.820
That's right.

12:40.580 --> 12:41.980
I'm happy for you.

12:48.570 --> 12:50.500
I need to see my mother.

12:51.200 --> 12:54.930
Let's go to Paris. Mary told us that she's staying at the Grand Hotel.

12:54.980 --> 12:56.500
I think Mrs. Milligan is there too.

12:56.910 --> 12:57.960
Okay.

12:58.310 --> 12:59.660
All right! Let's hurry!

12:59.670 --> 13:02.010
We'll be in trouble if Gaspard finds us.

13:02.300 --> 13:06.720
He's planning to ransom money from Mrs. Milligan in return for you.

13:07.230 --> 13:08.030
Right.

13:44.010 --> 13:45.750
Big brother Ricardo!

13:49.090 --> 13:50.600
What's going on, guys?

13:50.970 --> 13:53.300
We want to see Remy!

13:54.350 --> 13:57.520
Once Remy goes back to her mother, we'll never see her again.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.160
Yeah.

13:59.980 --> 14:03.370
Remy always told us that we're all her friends.

14:03.390 --> 14:07.600
I don't want to separate from her without saying goodbye or anything.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.030
Right then, let's go to Paris.

14:10.480 --> 14:12.290
If we go to the hotel, we'll probably see Remy.

14:12.750 --> 14:15.280
If we do that Gaspard will...

14:15.290 --> 14:16.460
I don't care what he does!

14:16.790 --> 14:18.790
Right.
- That's right!

14:29.380 --> 14:30.880
All right! Let's go!

14:30.900 --> 14:32.070
Let's go see Remy!

14:34.330 --> 14:35.770
Let's go!

14:36.530 --> 14:39.260
What happened?
Did Gaspard not show up?

14:39.710 --> 14:40.720
Yeah.

14:40.740 --> 14:43.530
He was supposed to come to the hotel at 3 pm this afternoon.

14:44.340 --> 14:45.530
What does this mean?

14:48.280 --> 14:51.530
What if something happened to miss Remy.

14:57.570 --> 14:58.800
Madam!

15:04.510 --> 15:05.790
Mother...

15:09.630 --> 15:11.120
She's all right.

15:11.270 --> 15:14.990
She's just sleeping because of the effects of the medicine the doctor gave her.

15:15.490 --> 15:17.310
The madam is very tired,

15:18.240 --> 15:22.820
since she's been supporting herself and her family all alone since her husband died.

15:26.070 --> 15:29.010
I won't make my mother worry anymore.

15:29.330 --> 15:31.570
From now on I'll support my mother.

15:34.280 --> 15:35.670
That's right.

15:35.710 --> 15:40.790
If miss Remy comes back, I want both of you to help your mother as much as you can.

16:07.860 --> 16:09.400
Mother...

16:31.580 --> 16:32.790
What's wrong, Capi?

16:44.890 --> 16:46.470
I see them! Over there!

16:46.480 --> 16:47.980
We won't let them get away this time!

16:54.460 --> 16:55.220
Remy!

16:57.230 --> 16:58.660
Sorry. I'm all right.

16:59.700 --> 17:00.900
Hurry up!

17:02.230 --> 17:04.170
Don't let them escape!

17:09.470 --> 17:11.710
There's no point in hiding!

17:28.050 --> 17:31.620
Mattia! Remy! Come out of there!

17:34.900 --> 17:35.870
This way!

17:52.140 --> 17:53.420
Mattia!

18:03.920 --> 18:05.320
Mattia! Look!

18:06.780 --> 18:09.110
Remy, we might be able to escape them!

18:20.920 --> 18:22.370
Remy, let's go!

18:25.790 --> 18:26.830
Hurry up!

18:30.190 --> 18:31.170
Hup!

18:39.080 --> 18:39.550
What should we do?

18:40.740 --> 18:42.430
I won't let them escape!

18:44.860 --> 18:46.120
We're in luck!

18:46.130 --> 18:48.680
We're taking the long way but we're heading for Paris.

18:52.900 --> 18:54.110
Thank you!

18:56.100 --> 18:57.950
It's all thanks to you.

18:58.890 --> 19:01.880
You always protect me.

19:25.380 --> 19:29.000
Once we get to Paris, we'll go our separate ways.

19:31.280 --> 19:33.110
Don't you feel sad?

19:36.420 --> 19:39.030
I want to stay together.

19:45.500 --> 19:50.040
But we can't. Remy has to go back to her mother.

19:58.920 --> 20:01.560
I wish we could keep traveling.

20:23.000 --> 20:24.860
Remy... Remy...

20:25.930 --> 20:27.190
Mother...

20:37.370 --> 20:38.660
Father...

20:40.310 --> 20:45.580
Please protect my mother and Remy.

20:58.960 --> 21:00.860
I fell asleep, didn't I?

21:02.050 --> 21:03.240
We'll be in Paris soon.

21:13.550 --> 21:15.240
<i>My mother...</i>

21:27.000 --> 21:29.170
Remy, let's hurry, to the Grand Hotel.

21:29.230 --> 21:30.020
Yup.

21:33.230 --> 21:34.500
We've been waiting for you!

21:34.830 --> 21:36.430
You've wasted our time!

21:36.680 --> 21:37.860
Gaspard!

21:55.800 --> 22:05.070
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:05.460 --> 22:15.810
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:16.850 --> 22:26.520
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:26.760 --> 22:36.550
From the future that gives us our fate

22:36.710 --> 22:45.720
Try to seek for them more

22:46.290 --> 22:49.970
Give your heart to

22:50.180 --> 23:05.170
That person who is also seeking you

23:19.080 --> 23:20.630
Mattia, any luck?

23:20.640 --> 23:23.460
It's no use.
There's no way out of here.

23:26.810 --> 23:28.340
Do you think Remy's in there?

23:28.780 --> 23:29.940
Probably.

23:29.950 --> 23:31.680
All right. Let's check it out.

23:32.720 --> 23:36.690
<i>My Mother</i>

23:32.720 --> 23:36.690
Next time:
